WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.037 --> 00:00:16.178
landed. Zombies stumbled out of Shop Well Supermarket.

2
00:00:17.258 --> 00:00:18.679
Crumbs were stuck to their mouths.

3
00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.461
Roxy saw a Le Sweet wrapper stuck to one zombie.

4
00:00:24.301 --> 00:00:25.102
Roxy gasped.

5
00:00:25.742 --> 00:00:28.003
"That zombie is the Mighty Man actor!"

6
00:00:29.083 --> 00:00:30.344
People were running and shouting.

7
00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:34.206
"Ahh! Zombies!"

8
00:00:34.506 --> 00:00:35.367
an old man cried.

9
00:00:38.549 --> 00:00:40.350
Three teenagers started to race away.

10
00:00:41.311 --> 00:00:42.672
Then one held up his phone.

11
00:00:42.692 --> 00:00:46.214
"I'm going to take a selfie with—Ahh!"

12
00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:51.958
"Grargh!" The Mighty Man zombie chomped the phone and then spit it out.

13
00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:54.300
The boy ran after his friends.

14
00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:58.062
Roxy saw several people huddled on top of a cab.

15
00:00:58.602 --> 00:01:00.664
"Rocket Girl, save us!"

16
00:01:02.188 --> 00:01:04.109
Zombies reached up, grabbing at the people.

17
00:01:05.489 --> 00:01:07.630
An old man swung his cane at the zombies.

18
00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:10.851
"Get away from us, you monsters!"

19
00:01:12.231 --> 00:01:14.372
Zoom! Roxy shot through the air.

20
00:01:14.992 --> 00:01:16.252
She blew her super breath.

21
00:01:17.272 --> 00:01:19.453
The zombies tumbled and rolled over each other.

22
00:01:19.473 --> 00:01:22.814
"Run!" Roxy told the people.

23
00:01:22.834 --> 00:01:24.714
"Find somewhere to hide.

24
00:01:25.234 --> 00:01:26.215
I'll be back soon!"

25
00:01:29.136 --> 00:01:30.776
Roxy flew to Le Sweet's Bakery.

26
00:01:32.176 --> 00:01:34.537
Inside, huge ovens lined one wall.

27
00:01:35.277 --> 00:01:36.417
Machines hummed loudly.

28
00:01:37.898 --> 00:01:40.539
Long belts filled with donuts rolled along slowly.

29
00:01:41.859 --> 00:01:43.640
One machine squirted icing onto donuts.

30
00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:47.201
Another machine dunked donuts into a tub of chocolate.

31
00:01:47.221 --> 00:01:50.222
"I have to shut this place down.

32
00:01:50.942 --> 00:01:53.643
It's making donuts—and zombies!"

33
00:01:56.624 --> 00:01:57.884
Roxy turned everything off.

34
00:02:00.812 --> 00:02:02.913
The bakery became still and silent.

35
00:02:04.713 --> 00:02:06.454
A second later Roxy heard footsteps.

36
00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:11.035
A man with an apron and a tall white hat hurried in.

37
00:02:11.055 --> 00:02:13.556
"What happened?"

38
00:02:13.816 --> 00:02:14.396
he cried.

39
00:02:16.176 --> 00:02:17.337
Then he spotted Roxy.

40
00:02:17.357 --> 00:02:19.017
"Rocket Girl!"

41
00:02:19.037 --> 00:02:21.958
"Sorry, sir," Roxy said.

42
00:02:21.978 --> 00:02:23.679
"You might not know this.

43
00:02:24.199 --> 00:02:26.900
But your donuts are causing a big problem.

44
00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.942
You see—" "You think you can stop me, do you?"

45
00:02:31.562 --> 00:02:33.544
The man glared at Roxy.

46
00:02:33.564 --> 00:02:35.565
"Huh?" Roxy was confused.

47
00:02:36.806 --> 00:02:37.787
The man continued.

48
00:02:38.227 --> 00:02:40.028
"My name is Pete Le Sweet.

49
00:02:40.889 --> 00:02:42.810
I invented a special donut recipe.

50
00:02:43.451 --> 00:02:49.736
It's so good, everybody will be hungry for one thing—my donuts!"

51
00:02:49.976 --> 00:02:50.496
He laughed.

52
00:02:50.516 --> 00:02:53.258
"And you won't stop me, Rocket Girl!"

53
00:02:54.259 --> 00:02:55.460
Roxy narrowed her eyes.

54
00:02:56.028 --> 00:02:58.509
"You planned to turn people into zombies?

55
00:02:59.229 --> 00:03:00.389
It wasn't an accident?"

56
00:03:01.349 --> 00:03:02.610
Le Sweet raised an eyebrow.

57
00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:04.650
"Huh? Zombies?"

58
00:03:05.691 --> 00:03:07.191
Roxy put her hands on her hips.

59
00:03:07.211 --> 00:03:10.312
"Your special recipe stinks, Le Sweet.

60
00:03:11.112 --> 00:03:13.673
Your donuts are turning people into zombies!"

61
00:03:14.893 --> 00:03:15.773
Le Sweet shrugged.

62
00:03:15.793 --> 00:03:19.034
"As long as I'm selling lots of donuts, who cares?"

63
00:03:19.854 --> 00:03:20.955
He put his hand on a lever.

64
00:03:20.975 --> 00:03:23.475
"Good-bye, Rocket Girl."

65
00:03:24.276 --> 00:03:25.516
Le Sweet pulled the lever.

66
00:03:27.485 --> 00:03:31.966
Chocolate syrup rushed out, completely covering Roxy!
